#. module: nme_inventory
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_nme_inventory
msgid ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Inventory\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Stock management of Nusantara Mini ERP: warehouses, transfers and a stock\n"
"move ledger valued with the average cost method.\n"
"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Features\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* Warehouses with an automatically created stock location; every new\n"
"  company gets its own warehouse.\n"
"* Transfers (``nme.picking``) of three types: receipts, deliveries and\n"
"  internal transfers between warehouses, with kanban, calendar and a\n"
"  printable delivery slip (Surat Jalan).\n"
"* **Stock move ledger**: the quantity on hand is never stored on the\n"
"  product; it is computed from done moves. Done moves are immutable and\n"
"  negative stock is refused.\n"
"* **Average cost (AVCO)** per company, updated by every receipt; deliveries\n"
"  and transfers are valued at the current average cost.\n"
"* Full returns of done transfers (returned deliveries come back at their\n"
"  original cost).\n"
"* Stock adjustments (stock opname) with a mandatory reason, validated by an\n"
"  inventory manager, plus a quick \"Update Quantity\" wizard on products.\n"
"* Minimum stock per product and company, with a daily scheduled action\n"
"  creating \"Low Stock\" activities for the inventory managers.\n"
"\n"
"Design notes\n"
"============\n"
"\n"
"Stock follows a double-entry logic: every move goes from one location to\n"
"another. Internal locations hold stock; virtual locations (Vendors,\n"
"Customers, Inventory Adjustment) are the counterparts. Quantities are\n"
"computed with grouped queries on the ledger (``_read_group``), filtered by\n"
"the ``warehouse_id`` or ``location_id`` context keys.\n"
"\n"
"Security\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Inventory / User*: creates and validates transfers, records stock counts.\n"
"* *Inventory / Manager*: validates stock adjustments, manages warehouses,\n"
"  locations and reasons.\n"
"* Every internal user can read the ledger; records are filtered by company.\n"
"\n"
"Credits\n"
"=======\n"
"\n"
"Author\n"
"------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"License\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"
msgstr ""
"=============================\n"
"Nusantara ERP - Persediaan\n"
"=============================\n"
"\n"
"Manajemen stok Nusantara Mini ERP: gudang, transfer, dan buku besar\n"
"pergerakan stok yang dinilai dengan metode biaya rata-rata.\n"
"\n"
"**Daftar isi**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Fitur\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"* Gudang dengan lokasi stok yang dibuat otomatis; setiap perusahaan baru\n"
"  mendapatkan gudangnya sendiri.\n"
"* Transfer (``nme.picking``) dengan tiga tipe: penerimaan, pengiriman, dan\n"
"  transfer internal antargudang, dilengkapi tampilan kanban, kalender,\n"
"  serta Surat Jalan yang dapat dicetak.\n"
"* **Buku besar pergerakan stok**: kuantitas stok tersedia tidak pernah\n"
"  disimpan pada produk; nilainya dihitung dari pergerakan yang sudah\n"
"  selesai. Pergerakan yang sudah selesai tidak dapat diubah dan stok\n"
"  negatif ditolak.\n"
"* **Biaya rata-rata (AVCO)** per perusahaan, diperbarui oleh setiap\n"
"  penerimaan; pengiriman dan transfer dinilai dengan biaya rata-rata saat\n"
"  ini.\n"
"* Retur penuh atas transfer yang sudah selesai (pengiriman yang diretur\n"
"  kembali dengan biaya aslinya).\n"
"* Penyesuaian stok (stock opname) dengan alasan wajib, divalidasi oleh\n"
"  manajer persediaan, serta wizard cepat \"Perbarui Kuantitas\" pada\n"
"  produk.\n"
"* Stok minimum per produk dan perusahaan, dengan tindakan terjadwal harian\n"
"  yang membuat aktivitas \"Stok Menipis\" untuk para manajer persediaan.\n"
"\n"
"Catatan Desain\n"
"==============\n"
"\n"
"Stok mengikuti logika pembukuan berpasangan (double-entry): setiap\n"
"pergerakan berpindah dari satu lokasi ke lokasi lain. Lokasi internal\n"
"menyimpan stok; lokasi virtual (Pemasok, Pelanggan, Penyesuaian\n"
"Persediaan) menjadi lawannya. Kuantitas dihitung dengan kueri terkelompok\n"
"pada buku besar (``_read_group``), difilter berdasarkan kunci konteks\n"
"``warehouse_id`` atau ``location_id``.\n"
"\n"
"Keamanan\n"
"========\n"
"\n"
"* *Persediaan / Pengguna*: membuat dan memvalidasi transfer, mencatat\n"
"  stock opname.\n"
"* *Persediaan / Manajer*: memvalidasi penyesuaian stok, mengelola gudang,\n"
"  lokasi, dan alasan.\n"
"* Setiap pengguna internal dapat membaca buku besar; data difilter\n"
"  berdasarkan perusahaan.\n"
"\n"
"Kredit\n"
"======\n"
"\n"
"Penulis\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"* M. Fadli Kurniawan\n"
"\n"
"Lisensi\n"
"-------\n"
"\n"
"LGPL-3\n"

